          {
            "title": "How many",
            "id": 58996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How many paragraphs will this webpage have?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Raindrops on roses Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles Warm woolen mittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">4</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You remove the heading from this code. How many paragraphs remain?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Raindrops on roses Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles Warm woolen mittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">3</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">4</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Closing tag",
            "id": 58994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the missing closing tag.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\\h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use matching opening and closing tags to place <code>Welcome</code> inside an <code>h1</code> heading.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\\h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Headings",
            "id": 58993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the right snippets to make the headings.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Console games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Mobile games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h4&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>, and finally <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use matching tags: make <code>Video games</code> the biggest heading and the two game types the second biggest headings.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Console games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Mobile games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h4&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>, and finally <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Create a big heading",
            "id": 59039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give this webpage the biggest heading.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make <code>Hello, World!</code> the biggest heading and give <code>Welcome</code> the second biggest heading.</p><p>Use matching opening and closing tags for each heading.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>, <code>Welcome</code>, and finally <code>&lt;/h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: opening tag",
            "id": 63940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with this webpage?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"3D Printers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Easy to get started\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Fun to play with\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Unlimited creativity\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">There is no opening <code>h1</code> tag</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The paragraph tags aren't assembled correctly</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Some closing tags are missing</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">There is no opening <code>h1</code> tag.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The page should start with a heading, then show three paragraphs. Which problem stops the heading from being assembled correctly?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"3D Printers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Easy to get started\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Fun to play with\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Unlimited creativity\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The first heading tag is a closing tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The paragraph elements use closing tags before their text</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The heading text belongs inside a paragraph element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The first heading tag is a closing tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 59583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with these emphasis tags?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Purple Haze\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">There's a <code>/</code> sign in the opening tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">There's no closing tag</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There's no content inside them</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">There's a <code>/</code> sign in the opening tag.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The text should be inside one emphasis element. What makes the first tag wrong?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Purple Haze\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It starts with <code>&lt;/</code>, so it is a closing tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It uses the wrong tag name for emphasis</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It puts the text outside both tags</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It starts with <code>&lt;/</code>, so it is a closing tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 8",
            "id": 59093,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the opening tag that defines text as important.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dr. Amp's Gold Shovels\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Order now - \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"only $29.99\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>strong</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wrap <code>only $29.99</code> in matching tags to mark that text as important.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dr. Amp's Gold Shovels\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Order now: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"only $29.99\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Order now:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, followed by <code>only $29.99</code>, and finally <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 59083,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why is the line break tag an empty tag?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Because it has no closing tag</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Because it has no effect on the structure of a webpage</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Because it has no opening tag</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because it has no closing tag.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You add <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> between two lines of text. Why do you not add <code>&lt;/br&gt;</code> after it?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Because <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> is an empty tag and has no closing tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> is a heading tag</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Because empty tags have no opening tag</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> is an empty tag and has no closing tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Text between the tags",
            "id": 67563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>Accept</code> on the button by coding between the opening and closing tags.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"By clicking accept, you agree to helping a friend this weekend.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accept\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"No way!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Reject\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Accept</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make the first button display <code>Accept</code> and keep the second button as <code>No way!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"By clicking accept, you agree to helping a friend this weekend.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accept\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"No way!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Agree\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Reject\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Accept</code>, followed by <code>No way!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Button tags",
            "id": 67567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the closing tag of the button displaying <code>Book a Room</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Joe's Bed and Breakfast\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"There's nothing more relaxing than booking a room at Joe's BnB.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Book a Room\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;/</code>, followed by <code>button</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the button that displays <code>Book a Room</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Joe's Bed and Breakfast\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"There's nothing more relaxing than booking a room at Joe's BnB.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Book a Room\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"131\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"booking a room\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Book a Room</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/</code>, <code>button</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Button tags",
            "id": 67535,
